Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:19.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.30,0:00:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  我是侍奉主的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel. I'm an angel of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我体内流着恶魔的血液  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got demon blood in me,dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整一个新等级的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a whole new level of freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:28.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝正试图打破这66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is trying to break the 66 seals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让路西法从地狱重获自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}To free lucifer from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是天使将我拯救出地狱的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would an angel rescue me from hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们有任务授予你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we have work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是护士  而是莉莉丝的御用主厨\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's no nurse. she's lilith's personal chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝恶魔的血  你从开始就应该知道这是错误的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucking blood? you got to know that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我多希望自己可以收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to god I could stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.73,0:00:51.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意完全交出自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give yourself over wholly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.23,0:00:53.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为上帝和天使们服务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the service of god and his angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是天使  不是吗  我是撒迦利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel,aren't you? I'm zachariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man is a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为了追求刺激才去喝恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not drinking the demon blood for kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是毒药  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's poison,sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看她都对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what she did to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是走出这扇门  就永远别回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walk out that door,don't you ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you cry no more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣玛丽女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}伊尔切斯特  马里兰州\N{\fnArial\fs30}1972年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.85,0:01:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god! no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在天上的父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father who art in...Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿人尊父的名为圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hallowed be thy name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿父的国降临  等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy kingdom come,blah,blah,blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带领我们远离诱惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead us not into temptation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救我们脱离邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But deliver us...from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深表赞同  修女们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truer words never spoken,huh,sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes it seems
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难理解造物者\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if it's difficult to know the creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我觉得特别是执着于字面意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I feel -- in a very literal sense --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就常会在追寻上帝的道路里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I have been wandering the desert for years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不是我们的天父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,not our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是我的天父\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.77,0:02:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  他还在监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}See,he's in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的天父将他囚禁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad put him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.27,0:02:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几乎放弃希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost gave up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但俗话说"要留有一点信仰"\N{\fnArial\fs30}But "ye of little faith"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我最终找到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I finally found him --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少  打开他牢门的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least,you know,the spot where his cage door opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:03:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天啊  居然在这么个不起眼的修道院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a damn convent,for god's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.63,0:03:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...father?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:07.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上你们的臭嘴  你这小荡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your friggin' pie hole,you little slut!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我觉得这么安排还是有道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again,I suppose it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们或许忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks forget --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我父亲也是一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy is an angel,after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假设有些蠢蛋站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,I suppose some dumb bastard stood here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流着他那虔诚的眼泪  寻思到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felt a jolt of his holy juice,and thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要为自己修建一所修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i'm gonna build me a nun factory."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个想法不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the right idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.10,0:03:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罪恶的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们中有人要祷告的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If any of you gals are the praying type,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可以开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now would be a good time to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第4季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法复苏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神晃去哪里啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head in the game,here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.16,0:04:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好  我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚说了我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.97,0:04:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道这不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I know hand-holding really isn't my thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但至少迪恩对你的抨击是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still,dean was wrong saying what he said to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他有权说那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,he was right to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怪他  毕竟是我不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,I don't blame him,after what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  等我们了结这事后  你们会和好如初的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,after we're done,you guys will patch things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:08.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们总是分分合合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的好像我曾有过将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking like I got an "after."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比  我能感觉到他在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it inside me,ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've changed --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在再也不能回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no going back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道自己应该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look... I know what I got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩还是离我越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's better off as far away from me as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样  都不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway,doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去摆平这一切吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get this done with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有在听我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to a word I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会给他打电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not calling him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我动枪  臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me get my gun,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日正邪交锋在即\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are damn near kickoff for armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不认为我们有更重要的任务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think we got bigger fish at the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你气坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're pissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是在替他的所作所为道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not making apologies for what he's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他和你有血缘关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's your... blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和我有血缘关系  这是不是就是你要说的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my blood -- is that what you're gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你亲弟弟  而且他堕落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your brother,and he's drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我试图帮助他  我真的尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby,I tried to help him. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就再试一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}So try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不呢  见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to face the facts --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆从来就不想成为这个家的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam never wanted part of this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他讨厌在这种生活状态下成长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated this life growing up --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他得到第一次机会就是远赴斯坦福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran away to Stanford first chance he got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就像是超时空效应历史再次重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's like da ja vu all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经厌倦追在他屁股后面跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I am sick and tired of chasing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚他的吧  他可以随心所欲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw him. He can do what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:01.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不是那个意思  - 不  鲍比  我就是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}-You don't mean that. -Yes,I do,bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至都不确定他还是不是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even sure if he's still my brother anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然他曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.65,0:07:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个蠢蛋  超级大蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid,stupid son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  哭去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,boohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾你的感情受挫了  我的小王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry your feelings are hurt,princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you under the impression
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人就应该要处处取悦你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that family's supposed to make you feel good --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还得给你烤个苹果派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bake you an apple pie,maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人就是让你为之担忧的一群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're supposed to make you miserable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们才成了一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they're family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他说过了  "出了这个门  就别再回来"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him,"You walk out that door,don't come back,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他就那么走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he walked out anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:45.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他选择了这种结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was his choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就像个满腹牢骚的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like a whiny brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和你老爸一个口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  让我来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,let me tell you something --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸就是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸可能有很多恶习  但他绝不是懦夫  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was a lot of things,Bobby,but a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.36,0:08:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他宁愿把萨姆赶得远远地也不愿意接近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd rather push sam away than reach out to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不认为那是勇敢的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that don't strike me as brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比任何时候的你老爸都要勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a better man than your daddy ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以就当成全我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you do both of us a favor --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别学他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.80,0:08:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去育儿室了  小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take you to the nursery,sugar --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让妈妈爸爸休息一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let mommy and daddy get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真是个漂亮的小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a beautiful child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely scrumptious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拍一  我拍一\N{\fnArial\fs30}patty-cake,patty-cake,baker's man
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小孩穿花衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}bake me a cake as fast as you can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拍二  我拍二\N{\fnArial\fs30}pat it and roll it and mark it with a "b"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个小孩梳小辫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put it in the oven --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来状态不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听听这个怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,how 'bout this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小查和小卡的顶级生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The suite life of Zack and Cass."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这算什么  我到底在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what is this? where the hell am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该叫它演员休息室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it a greenroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在正接近最后的高潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closing in on the grand finale,here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望在你闪亮登场之前保证你的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to keep you safe before showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来个汉堡包吧  你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try a burger. They're your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从特拉华州的海滨小屋来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From that seaside shack in Delaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你一次吃过11个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were 11,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:49.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:51.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不饿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"盖里甘的岛"第二季里的红发美女怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about ginger from season 2 of "Gilligan's island"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和她有一腿  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a thing for her,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:10:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有诱惑力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:10:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以免费让玛丽 安入伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll throw in Mary Ann for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃全像甲板  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's...bail on the holodeck,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道游戏计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what the game plan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们担心下这事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你  集中精力  放松心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you... focused,relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我有可能不爽然后离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm about to be pissed and leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在说吧  你个二\N{\fnArial\fs30}So start talking,chuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的封印都失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the seals have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个令人称奇的记录  这很\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's an impressive score. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真像是华府官员做出的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right up there with the Washington generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为这是恰当的挖苦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think sarcasm's appropriate,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你让所有事开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后的封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the final seal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it'll be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝会去打破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith has to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是唯一一个可以去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the only one who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明晚  午夜时分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow night -- midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们在努力找寻中  -好吧  努力点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're working on it.  - Well,work harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做我们的事  你只要做你自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do our job. You just make sure you do yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个到底是什么玩意  确切点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,and what is that,exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是阻止她的那个人  怎么做  用刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm supposed to be the one that stops her,how? with the knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一切都在掌握之中  -现在是个好时机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All in good time.  - Isn't now a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有点信心好吗  -什么  对你有信心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have faith.  - What,in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.37,0:12:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给个相信你的理由先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason why I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你发过誓你要效忠于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you swore your obedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以遵守命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}So obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没有恶魔陷阱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,no devil's trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看你自己 是在班门弄斧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you -- all 'rounded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是圣母玛利亚矗在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a-rod and Madonna over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是在吓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上你是在吓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you are,actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像还有很好的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 什么是我的策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look... what's my upside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.38,0:12:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你  你会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,I tell you,you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不告诉你  你还是要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't tell you,you still kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我逃离了这里  莉莉丝最终还是会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get away somehow,Lilith will definitely kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.59,0:13:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我的好处在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's my carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你死之前用不着担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what you should be worrying about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着担心会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is what happens before you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆  请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam. Leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,it's m-me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是刚好想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I'll just get right to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still pissed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还欠你一顿扁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I owe you a serious beatdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:14:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不该说那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I shouldn't have said what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.72,0:14:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I'm not dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄弟  我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're brothers. You know,we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.19,0:14:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论事情变得多糟  这都不会改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how bad it gets,that doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,I'm sorry --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下来  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算告诉我她在哪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll tell me where she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:40.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  只是  让我死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Fine. Just...let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明晚  午夜时分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow night... midnight...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会到修道院去\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be at a convent --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马里兰州  伊尔切斯特  名字是圣玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Mary's,Ilchester,Maryland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修道院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A convent?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会打破最后一个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna break the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.41,0:14:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一个封印是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is the final seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.48,0:15:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaaah! I don't know! I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.85,0:15:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓  我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在乞求你  请杀了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you -- kill me,please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们要带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we got to take her with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后的冲刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the final run on the death star,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要更多恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need more juice than I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你答应过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了  姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走路说话就能轻易打败别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a walking,talking can of whup-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  如今没几个人能信得过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Just can't trust anyone these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过至少你不能轻易地把我杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,least you won't be able to crack me open that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了  让你流血的不只我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget,it's not just me you're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我也很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact,I think I'm gonna take a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜意识的小睡会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siesta in the subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让身体也放松下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over the wheel for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.23,0:15:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注册护士辛迪·麦凯琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cindy Mccellen,r.n.,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:16:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算你狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣玛丽女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}伊尔切斯特  马里兰州 1972年
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天父  你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father,look...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不完全是祈祷的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not exactly the praying type,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我还是做出了牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still... I made the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你送来了那么多修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you a bagful of nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:59.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.63,0:17:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能听到我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能通过门小声跟我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you whisper through the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here,my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天父  听到你声音真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so good to hear your voice,padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找你很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been searching for you for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.53,0:17:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人都失去了自己的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others have lost faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是群异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dickless heathens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我如何救你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I bust you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天父  她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father,she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她被深深地困在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped neck-deep in the pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:17:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不好办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝可以打破封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith can break the seals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.77,0:18:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须给我找个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must find me a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个很特别的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very special child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.61,0:18:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What child?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣玛丽的开膛手\N{\fnArial\fs30}圣玛丽的神父在将8名修女开膛破肚后...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1972年  被遗弃的圣玛丽女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Mary's,abandoned in '72
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个牧师挖出八个女修女的肠子后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a priest disemboweled eight nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血流成河  不堪入目\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's black and white and red all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牧师说不是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The priest said it wasn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他声称是恶魔逼他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said a demon made him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还记得那个恶魔的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that he even remembered the demon's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.93,0:18:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿撒兹勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Azazel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:50.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝  黄眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,Lilith,yellow-eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名单上的人都来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the a-listers are paying visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必然要走到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly gives the joint credibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也正是最后一个封印被打破的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a place where the final seal goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说已经够好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把漂亮女护士带上  准备上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's pack up nurse betty and hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,maybe,um... look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们能找到另一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we can find another demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是不要伤害我的谎话  是在演戏而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That blubbery "don't hurt me" crap,it's just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在耍你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's playing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使是真的  还有个睡着的恶魔在她体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if she's not,there's still a hell-bitch snoozing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.23,0:19:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像你以前的做事风格  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like you haven't done this before,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  我叫辛迪·麦凯琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just,just listen to me,okay? My name is Cindy Mccellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:38.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃菲尔德纪念医院新生儿重症监护室的护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a nurse in the NICU over at Enfield Memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的丈夫叫马修  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a husband named Matthew,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们结婚6年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been married six years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.59,0:19:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定担心死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got to be worried sick about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连你是谁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't even know who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.56,0:19:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会把事情说出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not gonna tell anybody anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你放了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-o-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.83,0:19:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要见我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:14.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我有所求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,listen,I,uh,I-I need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:16.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要啥就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你带我去见萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to take me to see Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有话要对他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I got to talk to him about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天早上说的  你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The b.m. I took this morning. what's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要抓紧时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make it snappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这很不明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没问你意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I didn't ask you for your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你忘了你们上次见面的经历了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten what happened the last time you met?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.18,0:20:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正因如此才要去见\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我会乖乖听你们的话的  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,I'm gonna do whatever you mooks want,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.12,0:20:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就这么一个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to tie up this one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes -- that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.05,0:20:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说"不行"是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean,no?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被软禁在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that I'm trapped here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:56.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想去哪里都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我想见萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Super. I want to go see sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我想去散散心  -行啊  我陪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to take a walk.  - Fine. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我一个人去  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alone.  - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别废他妈话了  我要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Screw this noise. I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从哪扇门出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through what door?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一条来自迪恩的新语音留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}阅听\N{\fnArial\fs30}关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又不是12岁小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you,a 12-year-old girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做都做了还纠结啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just play it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.97,0:21:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管好你自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  真希望她能闭上嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}God,I wish she would just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你也能解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用那把刀杀了那么多恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the demons you cut with the knife,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.15,0:21:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换成天使又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think happens to the host?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这会让我感觉好过点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to make me feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你现在不好受  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you're having a tough time here,Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们已经快到终点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're in the final lap here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:21:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可不是娘娘腔的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time to grow a persqueeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能改改态度吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you drop the friggin' attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要去吸一个无辜的女人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to bleed and drink an innocent woman
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.03,0:22:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还当着她的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}While she watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是为了拯救世界啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And save the world as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I-I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.01,0:22:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.71,0:22:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许迪恩是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Dean was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会挺过去的  对吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna see this through,right,Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.83,0:22:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别像只咆哮的猴子似的出口成脏  行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit hurling feces like a howler monkey,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不太合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbecoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过你  外面很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told you... too dangerous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.79,0:23:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们到处徘徊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons on the prowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都生活在危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been getting my ass kicked all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:07.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在倒开始为我的安全着想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're sweating my safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.96,0:23:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要见我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个  太欠考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...ill-advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.36,0:23:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相当讨厌你废话连篇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I am so sick of your crap riddles
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.33,0:23:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且自以为是  大饼脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your smug,fat face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.77,0:23:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.77,0:23:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我不能见萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I see Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.97,0:23:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么去除掉莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how am I gonna ice Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.61,0:23:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去除掉莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}...going to ice lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.18,0:23:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝要打破最后一个封印了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith's going to break the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已是既成事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fait accompli at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火车已经离站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train's left the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我和萨姆  我们可以阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me and Sam,we can stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.23,0:23:50.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不想阻止天启  是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to stop it,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.97,0:23:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,末日近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end is nigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.27,0:23:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启即将降临  孩子  就在附近一家剧院\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse is coming,kiddo,to a theater near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:02.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还保护封印干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was all that crap about saving seals?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.18,0:24:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是障眼法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our grunts on the ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能公开全部真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't just tell them the whole truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.21,0:24:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你们还不全反了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have a full-scale rebellion on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:09.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.99,0:24:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是上面有人乐见其成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would we really let 65 seals get broken
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.09,0:24:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么会让他们轻易解开65道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless senior management wanted it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.03,0:24:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.83,0:24:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.53,0:24:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字吓人  营销失败  人人避之不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor name,bad marketing... puts people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.93,0:24:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实只不过是场大规模的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When all it is is Ali-Foreman...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.37,0:24:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拳王争霸赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a... slightly larger scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们胜券在握\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we like our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们获胜之后  那是一定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When our side wins -- and we will...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.01,0:24:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人间就是天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's paradise on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.38,0:24:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,what's not to like about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.98,0:24:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人类怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to all the people
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.85,0:24:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么承受你们的怒火之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}During your little pissing contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.05,0:24:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舍不得孩子套不着狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't make an omelet without cracking a few eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次舍的多了些而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this case... truckloads of eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.89,0:24:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之你明白咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you get the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.13,0:24:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.13,0:25:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.44,0:25:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是第一次清理地球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the first planetary enema we've delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.48,0:25:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,no,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.08,0:25:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甭拿那玩意敲我的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably shouldn't try to bash my skull in with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会喜欢结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't end up too pleasant for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.45,0:25:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那萨姆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会坐以待毙  他会阻止莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't go quietly. He'll stop Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.69,0:25:26.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆是计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam... has a part to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很重要的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.76,0:25:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可能需要些指导\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may need a little nudging in the right direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.63,0:25:33.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会保证他听话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll make sure he plays it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.80,0:25:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.27,0:25:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.74,0:25:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  萨姆 老是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,Sam,Sam. Marcia,Marcia,Marcia.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能忘了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about him,would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.45,0:25:46.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有大事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have larger concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我干嘛要告诉你真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I'm confiding in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.85,0:25:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仍是关键所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still vital,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.02,0:25:53.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能篡改你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't lying about your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过  细节部分会故意忽略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...omitted a few pertinent details.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这给改变不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:25:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是命定之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.74,0:26:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才能阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.79,0:26:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过  你要阻止的并非莉莉丝或是天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...not Lilith or the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.03,0:26:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.31,0:26:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.84,0:26:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要阻止的是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to stop Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:17.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是我们的小罗素·克劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our own little Russell Crowe,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拥有着完美的暴戾之气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete with surly attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.78,0:26:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当一切终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.25,0:26:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你取得最终的胜利时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you've won...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.59,0:26:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your rewards will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.60,0:26:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无与伦比的回馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unimaginable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.36,0:26:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,平静  幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace,happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来两个处女或是七十个兔女郎\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 virgins and 70 sluts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.06,0:26:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.31,0:26:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终有一天  我们再回头时定会笑看风云\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day,we'll look back on this and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.09,0:26:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝都去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's god in all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.95,0:26:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝早离我们而去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God has left the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.50,0:27:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:36.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士  这儿可是私人产业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady,this is private property.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.55,0:27:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该来这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.04,0:27:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我来这儿可是为了最广大人民群众\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm here for mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.91,0:27:41.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然也是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.19,0:27:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你联系不到他的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't reach him,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.96,0:27:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不在服务区了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're outside your coverage zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.19,0:28:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要对萨姆怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do to Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.23,0:28:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.93,0:28:08.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是让他放手一搏罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna do it to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.77,0:28:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.48,0:28:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  对了  对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,right,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.28,0:28:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可以越界的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to toe the company line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.41,0:28:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你来这儿干嘛  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here,cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.68,0:28:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  曾患难与共多时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been through much together,you and I,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想来说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉让事情发展到了如此地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry it ended like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.08,0:28:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sorry"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.03,0:28:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是世界末日啊  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's armageddon,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.61,0:28:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光抱歉可不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a bigger word than "sorry".
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.81,0:28:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得明白  一切早已注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to understand -- this is long foretold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少给我讲你那神圣的屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that "holy" crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.55,0:28:57.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运  上帝的安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny,God's plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.82,0:29:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全是骗人的  你个又蠢又笨的兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a bunch of lies,you poor,stupid son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.19,0:29:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是他们让你我卖命的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a way for your bosses to keep me and keep you in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.73,0:29:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么才是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.90,0:29:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人  这些家庭  他们才是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People,families -- that's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.30,0:29:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能眼睁睁看他们毁灭吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna watch them all burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么值得拯救的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is so worth saving?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在人间只看到了痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see nothing but pain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.31,0:29:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.35,0:29:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的罪孽  愤怒  迷惘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your guilt,your anger,confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.98,0:29:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在天堂  一切罪孽将被饶恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}In paradise,all is forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.32,0:29:28.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你将得到安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.85,0:29:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与萨姆和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你安你的宁去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take your peace...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.17,0:29:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带着你洁白无暇的屁股尽情安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And shove it up your lily-white ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.17,0:29:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿选择痛苦和罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'll take the pain and the guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿要这样的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll even take Sam as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.17,0:29:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不去天堂当模范婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot better than being some stepford bitch in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.51,0:29:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题很简单  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is simple,Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.21,0:29:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说战士以服从为天职\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more crap about being a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.12,0:29:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是是非问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a right and there is a wrong here,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.12,0:30:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.35,0:30:01.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.89,0:30:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里非常清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.52,0:30:06.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过要帮我  不是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna help me once,weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把你召回去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna warn me about all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.33,0:30:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正打算警告我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they dragged you back to bible camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我  现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.13,0:30:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.47,0:30:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.90,0:30:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我去找萨姆  在无法挽回之前阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me to Sam. We can stop this before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.00,0:30:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你去的话  我们会被追捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do that,we will all be hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.61,0:30:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这值得我们为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is anything worth dying for...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.95,0:30:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,付出生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.82,0:30:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个没骨气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spineless...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无情无义的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soulless son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.70,0:30:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕什么死  你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care about dying? You're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.33,0:30:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.13,0:30:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.14,0:30:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.06,0:31:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距圣玛丽女修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}还有两英里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.89,0:31:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  时候到了  到底动不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,it's time. Are we doing this or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.56,0:31:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.90,0:31:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.80,0:31:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就他妈一会儿  露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a damn minute,Ruby!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.20,0:31:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better think fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.71,0:31:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有新的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one unheard message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.98,0:31:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}First unheard message.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.95,0:31:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  吸血的畸形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me,you bloodsucking freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爸总说我要么救你要么杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad always said I'd either have to save you or kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.65,0:31:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I'm giving you fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救你的时候过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done trying to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.96,0:31:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个怪物  萨姆  吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a monster,Sam... a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.83,0:31:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:54.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有回头路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.85,0:32:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.25,0:32:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.93,0:32:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-o-o! aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.75,0:33:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能不能解释下你这是干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind explaining just what the hell you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.06,0:33:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一会儿就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be gone long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.62,0:33:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上去找萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find Sam now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.89,0:33:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.23,0:33:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我知道有人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.86,0:33:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得阻止他杀死莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop him,Dean,from killing Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.70,0:33:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是莉莉丝会打开最后一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lilith's gonna break the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.37,0:33:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝就是最后一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.40,0:33:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一死  末日就降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}She dies,the end begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.32,0:33:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(复苏的路西法 卡佛·爱德伦  作)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.00,0:33:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-that sounds...moist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.87,0:33:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么收费\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,what are your rates?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.54,0:33:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个女孩  一小时  一千美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get you one girl,one hour -- $1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.74,0:34:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.07,0:34:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我叫20个  包夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then,uh,I'll take 20 girls for the whole night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生  您确定自己付得起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um,sir,I'm not sure you can afford that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.28,0:34:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  今朝有酒今朝醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady,sometimes you got to live like there's no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  不该是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. T-t-this isn't supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.49,0:34:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.79,0:34:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  我说的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,lady,this is definitely supposed to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.72,0:34:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们待会儿再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just got to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.29,0:34:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.84,0:34:35.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.14,0:34:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将拯救这个世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.90,0:35:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣玛丽  是什么  是间女子修道院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Mary's? what is it,a convent?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.04,0:35:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但你们俩不该出现在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but you guys aren't supposed to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.27,0:35:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这故事没你们的份儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not in this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.83,0:35:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  话虽如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.90,0:35:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但去了就自然有我们的份儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're making it up as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.92,0:35:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(复苏的路西法 卡佛·爱德伦  作)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.68,0:35:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  哥们  别再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw,man! not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.65,0:35:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the archangel!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.82,0:35:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来对付他  交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold him off! I'll hold them all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.12,0:35:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去拦着萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.48,0:36:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.41,0:36:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.40,0:36:28.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就好好露一手给我看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.70,0:36:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.64,0:36:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.13,0:36:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.02,0:36:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.04,0:36:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.58,0:37:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在磨蹭什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.04,0:37:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.04,0:37:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.33,0:37:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.53,0:37:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.97,0:37:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你千辛万苦地把自己变成一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned yourself into a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个真真正正的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.44,0:37:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到临门一脚时却不发威了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're not gonna bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.35,0:37:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  但这真的很可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,but that is honestly adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.38,0:38:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.36,0:38:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比  这怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby,what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.61,0:38:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.53,0:38:42.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然这一路走来总是磕磕碰碰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,it was a little touch-and-go there for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.07,0:38:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  最终你还是完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.19,0:38:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我  我到底完成了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? what -- what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.21,0:38:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开启了那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.08,0:38:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  他终于自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's free at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.15,0:38:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他终于自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's free at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.59,0:38:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.34,0:38:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  他  莉莉丝  我已经阻止了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,he -- Lilith -- I stopped her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.27,0:38:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经杀了她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.41,0:38:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而古书中写道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is written
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.86,0:39:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一个恶魔正是最后一道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the first demon shall be the last seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.59,0:39:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是你破除了这道封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you bust her open.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜看即将登场的会是谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now guess who's coming to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.03,0:39:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶滴神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.04,0:39:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再猜猜看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.42,0:39:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你无法体味这有多艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know how hard this was --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.78,0:39:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本就不把任何恶魔放在眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the demons out for my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.85,0:39:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.98,0:39:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比那群杂碎强大多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the best of those sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.98,0:39:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忠诚多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most loyal!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.59,0:39:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连阿拉斯泰尔也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even Alastair knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.82,0:39:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有莉莉丝知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Lilith!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.22,0:39:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我知道你现在一定会愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I'm sure you're a little angry right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.39,0:39:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  得了吧  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,I mean,come on,sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.06,0:39:37.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不得不承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you have to admit --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.62,0:39:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  就是个活孔明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.93,0:39:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.07,0:39:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个满口谎言的贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lying bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.58,0:39:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别自讨没趣了  萨姆  没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt yourself,sammy. it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.98,0:39:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付完莉莉丝就是你的极限了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot your payload on the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.92,0:40:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.35,0:40:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你故意引我上瘾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poisoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.46,0:40:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.73,0:40:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那血无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.36,0:40:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是你  你自己的选择问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you... and your choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.76,0:40:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你不过是选项\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gave you the options,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.11,0:40:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而享有选择自由的人可是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you chose the right path every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.11,0:40:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不用我在后推波助澜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't need the feather to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.32,0:40:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然而然就水到渠成了  小飞象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had it in you the whole time,Dumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.55,0:40:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这让你很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to see it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.75,0:40:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这可是期盼已久的奇迹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a miracle so long coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.92,0:40:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿撒兹勒和莉莉丝所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything Azazel did and Lilith did
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.39,0:40:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过都是为了能引你到这一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to get you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.89,0:40:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是唯一能办到这一切的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were the only one who could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.16,0:40:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.36,0:40:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为  为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.83,0:40:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.70,0:40:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为舍你其谁呢  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it had to be you,Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.90,0:40:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这非你莫属\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always had to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.37,0:40:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拯救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.14,0:40:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让他重获自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set him free.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.98,0:41:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会感激你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's gonna be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.98,0:41:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会好好补偿你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna repay you in ways that you can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.62,0:41:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.62,0:41:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.45,0:41:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.09,0:41:51.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  咱赶紧离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.63,0:41:53.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.33,0:41:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
